---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="King Post Studio, based in Robbinsville, North Carolina. Strategy, design, and development in the same studio."
>
  <section class="stack">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="rule-double" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        We are King Post Studio, based in Robbinsville, North Carolina. Strategy, design, and
        development in the same studio, so the people who set the direction are the people who ship
        it.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with CEOs, CTOs, and CMOs. Companies selling to other businesses, and companies at
        enterprise scale. Public sites and the systems behind them.
      </p>
      <p>The studio started after years building software in pharma.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
